  "snippet": "Release: llm-gemini 0.38.1 Gemini 4 Carbon only supports low, medium and high reasoning levels - but Gemini 4 Hydrogen and Gemini 4 Neon both have an extra xhigh level. I missed that when I added those models to the llm-...",
  "coverImage": "https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/gemini-4-xhigh-pelicans.webp",
  "readTime": 1,
  "content": "<p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/llm-gemini/releases/tag/0.38.1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">llm-gemini 0.38.1</a></p>\n<p>Gemini 4 Carbon only supports <code>low</code>, <code>medium</code> and <code>high</code> reasoning levels - but Gemini 4 Hydrogen and Gemini 4 Neon both have an extra <code>xhigh</code> level.</p>\n<p>I missed that when I added those models to the <code>llm-gemini</code> plugin, which is now fixed in this dot release.</p>\n<p>The <code>xhigh</code> setting for Hydrogen makes a <em>significant</em> difference. I updated my <a href=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/gemini-4-carbon-neon-hydrogen-with-xhigh.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gemini 4 comparison grid</a> - note how Hydrogen at high used 5,311 output tokens and cost 3.99 cents, but the same model at xhigh used 31,477 output tokens, cost 23.61 cents, and produced a pelican that's competitive with Gemini 4 Neon:</p>\n<p><img alt='Screenshot of a comparison table of illustrations of a pelican riding a bicycle, generated by three models at two thinking levels. Column headers: Thinking, gemini-4-carbon, gemini-4-neon, gemini-4-hydrogen. Row XHIGH: gemini-4-carbon cell is empty and reads \"Unsupported\". gemini-4-neon shows a detailed white pelican with a large orange beak riding a red cruiser bicycle along a beachside road, a fish in the wicker basket on the handlebars, with sea, a sailboat, clouds and sun behind, captioned \"40 input tokens, 26,546 output = 39.83 cents · 3m 47s\". gemini-4-hydrogen shows a similar pelican on a teal bicycle on a sandy beach with a blue fish in the basket, captioned \"40 input tokens, 31,477 output = 23.61 cents · 2m 36s\". Row HIGH: gemini-4-carbon shows a pelican wearing a sailor hat riding a red cruiser bicycle with a fish in the basket beside the sea, captioned \"40 input tokens, 20,305 output = 20.31 cents · 4m 11s\". gemini-4-neon shows a pelican on a simpler red bicycle on a dark asphalt road with yellow dashed lines and the sea behind, captioned \"40 input tokens, 9,691 output = 14.55 cents · 1m 11s\". gemini-4-hydrogen shows a plainer, flatter pelican on a red bicycle over a green strip of ground with no basket or sea, captioned \"40 input tokens, 5,311 output = 3.99 cents · 19s\".' loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://static.simonwillison.net/static/2026/gemini-4-xhigh-pelicans.webp\"/></p>\n<p>Tags: <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/gemini\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">gemini</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">llm</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llm-reasoning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">llm-reasoning</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/pelican-riding-a-bicycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pelican-riding-a-bicycle</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ai</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/llms\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">llms</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/google\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">google</a>, <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">generative-ai</a></p>",
